0190273325000070/0001902733-25-000070-index.htm"},{"date":"2025-05-20","form":"8-K/A","codes":["2.02","7.01","9.01"],"events":[{"label":"Results announced","kind":"results","tone":"blue"},{"label":"Regulation FD disclosure","kind":"news","tone":"blue"}],"url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1902733/000190273325000067/0001902733-25-000067-index.htm"}],"legal_events":[{"date":"2024-10-21","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1902733/000090266424005919/0000902664-24-005919-index.htm","tone":"warn"},{"date":"2022-01-18","label":"Activist or control stake disclosed","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1902733/000089914022000084/0000899140-22-000084-index.htm","tone":"warn"}],"summary":{"sentences":["nCino, Inc. files with the SEC under \"Services-Prepackaged Software\", based in NC, and has been publicly reporting for 4 years.","It reported $604.5m of revenue over the trailing four quarters, up 10.6% against the same quarter a year earlier, at a gross margin of 63.3%.","Listed on Nasdaq, it funds itself from operations ($221.5m of operating cash flow over the year)."],"generated":true,"note":"Assembled from filing metadata and XBRL figures. Not editorial judgement - and rule 7 asks whether *you* can explain it, so rewrite this in your own words before you rely on it."},"bull":[{"text":"Revenue grew 10.6% year on year (Q1 2026 vs Q1 2025), reaching $159.4m in the quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1902733/000190273326000066/0001902733-26-000066-index.htm","accession":"0001902733-26-000066"},{"text":"Growth has been positive in all 8 year-on-year comparisons, so this is a trend rather than one good quarter.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1902733/000190273326000066/0001902733-26-000066-index.htm","accession":"0001902733-26-000066"},{"text":"Gross margin of 63.3% means most of each additional sale falls through to cover fixed costs.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1902733/000190273326000066/0001902733-26-000066-index.htm","accession":"0001902733-26-000066"},{"text":"Gross margin expanded from 60.0% to 63.3% against the same quarter a year earlier - the company is keeping more of what it sells, not buying growth with discounts.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1902733/000190273326000066/0001902733-26-000066-index.htm","accession":"0001902733-26-000066"},{"text":"Operating cash flow is positive at $221.5m over the trailing year, so the business funds itself and is not dependent on raising money.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1902733/000190273326000066/0001902733-26-000066-index.htm","accession":"0001902733-26-000066"},{"text":"Share count is close to flat (-6.1% over the year), so growth in the business accrues to existing holders rather than being diluted away.","source_url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1902733/000190273326000066/0001902733-26-000066-index.htm","accession":"0001902733-26-000066"}],"bear":[{"text":"Base rate: 57.8% of US common stocks underperformed one-month Treasury bills over their lifetimes (Bessembinder, Journal of Financial Economics, 2018). Nothing above changes that starting point.","source_url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfineco.2018.06.004"}],"triggers":[{"id":"gross_margin_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Gross margin falls below 55.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"gross_margin","comparison":"below","threshold":0.55,"consecutive":2,"current":0.633,"current_display":"63.3%","threshold_display":"55.0%","fired":false,"rationale":"Eight points of margin is a real deterioration rather than noise. Two consecutive quarters stops one bad quarter from forcing a sale.","editable":true},{"id":"growth_floor","kind":"metric","label":"Revenue growth falls below -4.0% for 2 consecutive quarters","metric":"revenue_growth_yoy","comparison":"below","threshold":-0.04,"consecutive":2,"current":0.106,"current_display